            "line": 133,
            "text": "theorem slope_dn (hD : D.Admissible) (h : IsTrajectory D u v a b)\n    (h0 : v a ∈ D.Safe) {c t : ℝ} (hc : 0 ≤ c) (hmargin : D.eps < D.Idn c)\n    (ht : t ∈ Ico a b) (hu : D.VIH ≤ u t) (hv : c ≤ v t) :\n    rderiv v t ≤ -((D.Idn c - D.eps) / D.Chi) := by"
